                                    <p class="nw-w-txt-9">
                                        Proof-of-reserve is a verifiable, continuously updated on-chain data feed
                                        powered by Chainlink nodes. Every four hours, Chainlink's decentralized oracle
                                        network queries the client's data and pushes an updated reserve.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
