            <section class="top-crp-new-banner-1 pb-0">
                <div class="container-fluid col-lg-10">
                    <h2 class="nw-w-head-1 text-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
                        How the Gold Tokenization Process Works
                    </h2>
                    <div
                        class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-lg-3 row-cols-xl-3 g-4 justify-content-center g-4">

                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card" data-aos="fade-up">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h3 class="card-title">Step 1 - Physical Gold Enters the Vault</h3>
                                    <p class="card-text">
                                        The process begins when physical gold is purchased by the client from
                                        LBMA-certified refiners. The vault operator records each bar's serial number,
                                        weight, purity certification, and storage location using the vault management
                                        system.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card" data-aos="fade-up">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h3 class="card-title">Step 2 - Investors Buy, Hold, and Trade XGLD</h3>
                                    <p class="card-text">
                                        Once tokens are in the issuance pool, verified investors can purchase XGLD
                                        through the retail interface or professional terminal. Holdings appear
                                        immediately in the investor's portfolio dashboard by displaying real-time gram
                                        value.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card" data-aos="fade-up">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h3 class="card-title">Step 3 - Income Events and Corporate Actions</h3>
                                    <p class="card-text">
                                        While physical gold does not generate yield in the traditional sense, the
                                        platform supports structured gold lending programmes where consented token
                                        holders can participate in gold lending pools.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card" data-aos="fade-up">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h3 class="card-title">Step 4 - Redemption and Physical Delivery</h3>
                                    <p class="card-text">
                                        The system validates their KYC status and holding balance, confirms the
                                        redemption quantity against available vault inventory, and generates a
                                        redemption instruction to the relevant vault facility.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="nw-banner-sec-6 nw-ban-sec-6-2 py-5">
