                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h3 class="card-title mb-2">The Vault Integration Is the Hard Part</h3>
                                    <p class="card-text">Building the vault API layer first, and making it the
                                        authoritative source of truth for all token minting events, meant the
                                        proof-of-reserve system was accurate from mainnet operation.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card bg-transparent py-0" data-aos="fade-up" style="border-radius: 8px;">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h3 class="card-title mb-2">Proof-of-Reserve Builds Trust</h3>
                                    <p class="card-text">A live, continuously updated, on-chain proof-of-reserve system
                                        is technically more complex to build than a quarterly audit PDF. It is also
                                        infinitely more valuable to investors.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <div class="card bg-transparent py-0" data-aos="fade-up" style="border-radius: 8px;">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h3 class="card-title mb-2">Same Platform For Retail and Institutional Investors</h3>
                                    <p class="card-text">The temptation in building a gold tokenization platform is to
                                        target one user profile, either the retail investor with a simple,
                                        consumer-friendly app or the institutional trader.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

